<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE reference PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 2.x Reference//EN" "reference.dtd">
<reference id="_Toc235450375" xml:lang="en-us">
   <title>Scenario 19 — Table Between Numbered List in a Procedure</title>
   <refbody>
      <section id="sec_d539e7">
         <p>Consider a procedure where the author inserts a configuration table between two numbered steps as plain reference information.</p>
         <table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
            <title>Table between steps in procedure</title>
            <tgroup cols="2">
               <colspec colname="c1"/>
               <colspec colname="c2"/>
               <thead>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <b>HTML Input</b>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>
                        <b>DITA Output</b>
                     </entry>
                  </row>
               </thead>
               <tbody>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock id="codeblock_onf_mgp_lkc">
&lt;h2 id="configure-server">Configure the Server&lt;/h2>
&lt;ol>
  &lt;li>
    Open the server configuration file.
    &lt;table>
      &lt;caption>Server parameters&lt;/caption>
      &lt;tr>
        &lt;th>Parameter&lt;/th>
        &lt;th>Value&lt;/th>
      &lt;/tr>
      &lt;tr>
        &lt;td>Port&lt;/td>
        &lt;td>8080&lt;/td>
      &lt;/tr>
      &lt;tr>
        &lt;td>Timeout&lt;/td>
        &lt;td>60&lt;/td>
      &lt;/tr>
    &lt;/table>
  &lt;/li>
  &lt;li>Save the configuration file.&lt;/li>
&lt;/ol></codeblock>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock id="codeblock_vqy_4gp_lkc">
&lt;task id="configure_server">
  &lt;title>Configure the Server&lt;/title>
  &lt;taskbody>
    &lt;steps>
      &lt;step>
        &lt;cmd>Open the server configuration file.&lt;/cmd>
        &lt;info>
          &lt;table>
            &lt;title>Server parameters&lt;/title>
            &lt;tgroup cols="2">
              &lt;colspec colname="c1"/>
              &lt;colspec colname="c2"/>
              &lt;thead>
                &lt;row>
                  &lt;entry>Parameter&lt;/entry>
                  &lt;entry>Value&lt;/entry>
                &lt;/row>
              &lt;/thead>
              &lt;tbody>
                &lt;row>
                  &lt;entry>Port&lt;/entry>
                  &lt;entry>8080&lt;/entry>
                &lt;/row>
                &lt;row>
                  &lt;entry>Timeout&lt;/entry>
                  &lt;entry>60&lt;/entry>
                &lt;/row>
              &lt;/tbody>
            &lt;/tgroup>
          &lt;/table>
        &lt;/info>
      &lt;/step>
      &lt;step>
        &lt;cmd>Save the configuration file.&lt;/cmd>
      &lt;/step>
    &lt;/steps>
  &lt;/taskbody>
&lt;/task></codeblock>
                     </entry>
                  </row>
               </tbody>
            </tgroup>
         </table>
         <p>
            <b>Result</b>: The table is mapped to <codeph>&lt;choicetable&gt;</codeph> because it presents options that the user must choose from while performing the step, rather than a plain reference table.</p>
      </section>
   </refbody>
</reference>
